WEBVTT

00:00.049 --> 00:03.394
This is Brooke, the firm's
virtual intake assistant.

00:03.954 --> 00:05.192
How can I help you today?

00:05.492 --> 00:08.328
Um, I need to make an
appointment for a consultation.

00:08.627 --> 00:09.203
Sure.

00:09.509 --> 00:11.309
May I have your first and last name?

00:11.610 --> 00:14.717
Will you be filing individually
or jointly with a spouse?

00:15.017 --> 00:16.704
Individually Got it.

00:17.216 --> 00:21.451
Do you currently own a business or have
you owned one in the last few years?

00:21.751 --> 00:22.220
No.

00:22.520 --> 00:23.033
Okay.

00:23.596 --> 00:26.231
Now, let's get you a free consultation.

00:26.567 --> 00:28.359
What day and time work best for you?

00:28.659 --> 00:30.759
Thursday or Friday would be best.

00:31.059 --> 00:33.709
We can do Zoom . What works best for you?

00:34.008 --> 00:34.680
Zoom

00:34.980 --> 00:35.380
Got it.

00:35.769 --> 00:36.596
Zoom works.

00:37.236 --> 00:40.730
What time of day on Thursday
or Friday works best for you?

00:41.236 --> 00:42.364
Morning or afternoon?

00:42.377 --> 00:43.955
After three o'clock.

00:44.255 --> 00:46.272
Let's look at Thursday first.

00:46.727 --> 00:50.995
Please confirm the Thursday date you mean,
and I'll check for available appointment

00:50.995 --> 00:52.803
slots after three in the afternoon.

00:53.103 --> 00:54.366
Yeah, this Thursday would be great.

00:54.454 --> 00:57.489
After 3:00 Let me check for
available appointment slots.

00:57.778 --> 00:58.314
One moment.

00:58.584 --> 01:03.638
I can offer Thursday at three in
the afternoon or Thursday at four.

01:04.215 --> 01:05.830
Which time would you like me to book?

01:06.131 --> 01:07.028
Four o'clock.

01:07.328 --> 01:07.842
Great.

01:08.280 --> 01:10.634
I can book the four in the afternoon slot.

01:11.167 --> 01:13.426
Let me book the appointment for you.

01:13.726 --> 01:14.500
Perfect.

01:14.589 --> 01:16.629
One moment while I finalize that for you.

01:16.908 --> 01:20.238
You're all set for Thursday
at four in the afternoon.

01:20.980 --> 01:24.334
You'll get the intake form and
a confirmation text shortly.

01:25.000 --> 01:28.673
Please complete the form before your
appointment so the attorney can prepare.

01:28.973 --> 01:31.334
Is there anything else I
can help with, ? Thank you.

01:31.371 --> 01:31.771
Nope.

01:32.071 --> 01:34.327
You're very welcome,
have a great afternoon
